        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ant & Dec, Anthony McPartlin, Declan Donnelly\n- Products: PokerFace\n- Roles: creators, hosts\n- Places: Newcastle upon Tyne, England\n\nFacts:\n- Anthony McPartlin was born on 18 November 1975.\n- Declan Donnelly was born on 25 September 1975.\n- Anthony McPartlin and Declan Donnelly are collectively known as Ant & Dec.\n- Ant & Dec are an English comedy TV presenting, television producing, acting, and former music duo from Newcastle upon Tyne, England.\n- Ant & Dec created PokerFace.\n- Ant & Dec host PokerFace.",
